{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Golden Season Pack brings a set of hero skins to <i>Across the Obelisk</i>. Your heroes take on new looks inspired by the elegance of Eastern myths and traditions, with designs that highlight themes of honor, wisdom, resilience, and transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This skin pack celebrates both grandeur and subtlety, giving each character a unique identity\u2014whether as an emperor crowned in draconic splendor, a fox-touched spellcaster, or a steadfast guardian rooted in nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Golden Season Pack, your party gains a new shine, ready to face their adventures with a touch of legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this pack you will find 10 new hero skins:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnus, The Dragon Emperor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Andrin, The Honorbound</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evelyn, The Fox Witch</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reginald, The Silent Palm</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heiner, The Iron General</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ottis, The Rakebearer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nezglekt, The Keeper of the Land</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thuls, The Gilded Oni</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bree, The Sacred Horn</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amelia, Radiant Feather</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013420?t=1759924782","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013420?t=1759924782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013420/4c2cc7f16e0752c97a82c0849d8ae1ce88743e3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759924782","capsule_imagev5"